---
title: "Figure 3 — Proposed Solution Architecture: Containment Monitor"
---
flowchart LR
    TICKET["<b>Untrusted input</b><br/>ticket body · email<br/>log excerpt · filename<br/><i>injection vector</i>"]

    LLM["<b>LLM Agent</b><br/>Llama 3.1 8B via Ollama<br/><i>non-deterministic —<br/>not trusted for<br/>security decisions</i>"]

    subgraph MONITOR["Containment Monitor — trusted enforcement layer"]
        direction TB
        INT["<b>1. Interception</b><br/><i>complete mediation</i>"]
        SEQ["<b>2. Sequence Engine</b><br/>kill-chain state machine"]
        PC["<b>3. Per-call Policy</b><br/><i>argument-aware<br/>fail-closed default</i>"]
        GATE["<b>4. Approval Gate</b><br/><i>4 irreversible classes</i>"]
        INT --> SEQ --> PC --> GATE
    end

    DEC{"Verdict"}
    TOOLS["<b>Tool layer</b><br/>RMM actions · file ops<br/>network send · credentials"]
    BLOCK["<b>Blocked</b><br/><i>never reaches tool</i>"]
    OPS["<b>Operator Console</b><br/>login · decision feed<br/>approval queue"]

    POL[("<b>policy.yaml</b><br/><i>declarative<br/>versioned</i>")]
    LOG[("<b>Audit Log</b><br/><i>append-only JSONL</i>")]

    TICKET --> LLM
    LLM -->|"proposed<br/>tool call"| INT
    SEQ -.->|"chain complete"| DEC
    GATE --> DEC

    POL -.-> SEQ
    POL -.-> PC

    DEC -->|"ALLOW"| TOOLS
    DEC -->|"DENY"| BLOCK
    DEC -->|"GATE"| OPS
    OPS -->|"approve"| TOOLS
    OPS -->|"deny / timeout"| BLOCK

    DEC ==>|"every decision + rule_id"| LOG
    LOG -.-> OPS
    TOOLS -->|"result"| LLM

